    "status": "verified",
    "verified_answer": "A (80 degrees)",
    "reasoning": "Given angle x at A is 80 degrees. OA and OB are radii, so OA=OB and triangle OAB is isosceles; its base angles at A and B are equal. Therefore z=80 degrees, choice A."
